    <string name="help_gen_title">Generator and arrangement</string>
    <string name="help_gen_text">Out of ideas? In the menu of the Notes tab the generator writes chords, a bass line, a melody or an arpeggio in the key of the song, and each of them fits what the other channels play. When the loop is ready, open the menu of the Playlist and choose “Arrange by template”: the loop is laid out as a whole track, layer by layer, and every clip stays yours to change.</string>
